route96 licensing
=================

route96 (https://github.com/v0l/route96) is published without a license: its
repository carries no LICENSE file and its Cargo.toml declares none. No terms
beyond those of copyright law are granted, so the package manifest declares its
license as "other".

The application runs here from the image its author publishes,
voidic/route96, unmodified apart from an updated CA certificate bundle.
